criminal justice correctly.

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:12.680
Look at the war on drugs.

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:13.970
Look at mass incarceration.

00:02:13.970 --> 00:02:14.970
Look at cannabis.

00:02:14.970 --> 00:02:16.500
Look all these different things.

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:23.020
But I have mostly believed that in a time
